        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Evening, 47. Your target is Omar Al-Gazali, head of the powerful Al-Gazali family and host of the inauguration of the Burj Al-Gazali. Beneath his reputation as a philanthropist, Omar finances arms trafficking and covert influence operations that threaten ICA interests. The client requires his elimination during his opening speech, ensuring maximum symbolic impact while severing his public persona from the power he commands. Precision and discretion remain paramount.",
